# Fleeting Flight prevents combat damage only (CR 615.1). Bot1's Memnite becomes a 2/2 flier on turn 3; Bot2 then bolts it
# for 3 damage, which is not combat damage and is not prevented: it dies, with its counter, and Flight is in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Memnite
Fleeting Flight
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fleeting Flight.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Fleeting Flight
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
